    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's more than just a coping mechanism. it feels permanent. like this is just who i am now. there's no \"getting through it\" because there's nothing to get through to. i just feel so incredibly stuck. sometimes i wonder if there's even a way to get back to feeling something, or if the only way to actually find peace from this constant, heavy nothingness is to just... let go of it all.",
